From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ombra engine maintainers <engine@ombra.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] shared RPC host protocol integration

What: Wire the feature modules into the shared RPC dispatcher, state and generated schema.
Why: Host features share transport and command definitions, which must remain coherent.
Upstream-Status: Ombra-only integration.

